# Integer8 multiplication within range

Verifies int8 multiplication with operands chosen to stay inside the 8-bit
range through the complete CLI pipeline.

>>> source
left: int8 = 10
right: int8 = 12
neg_left: int8 = -10

// Verifies multiplication of two positive operands.
pos_product: int8 = left * right
print(pos_product)

// Verifies multiplication with opposite signs.
mixed_product: int8 = neg_left * right
print(mixed_product)

<<< stdout
120
-120

<<< stderr
